flowchart LR
    User[User / Student / Teacher]
    Shell[Terminal / CLI shell]
    Project[Target project folder]
    PH[project-health CLI]
    PythonEnv[Local Python environment]
    Docker[Docker / Docker Compose]
    Output[Terminal or JSON report]

    User -->|runs pha scan PATH| Shell
    Shell --> PH
    PH -->|reads files| Project
    PH -->|checks python, pip, packages| PythonEnv
    PH -->|checks docker tools when required| Docker
    PH -->|prints result| Output
    Output --> User

    Project -. contains .-> README[README]
    Project -. contains .-> License[LICENSE]
    Project -. contains .-> Git[.git / .gitignore]
    Project -. contains .-> BuildFiles[pyproject.toml / requirements / Dockerfile / compose.yaml]
